[profiles.guide]
notes = '''Hold {select} and {start} together to pause the gyro while you reposition the controller. Hold {start} to switch the gyro off or on, and hold {r3} to recenter it.
{start} (Escape) opens the game's menu and closes the other screens.
{south} picks up and uses things; hold {south} to sprint. {east} jumps, and {l3} toggles crouch. {rt} punches, swings or shoots what you're holding, {lt} is the right mouse button, and {north} drops your item.
Hold {west} to talk on proximity voice chat. {up} opens the text chat: type with the on-screen keyboard ({guide} + {west}), then press Enter. Hold {select} for the player list.
These keys are written from memory and not checked in the game (sprint, crouch, drop, voice and chat especially); compare them with the game's Settings → Controls and change the buttons here to match. The gyro's full turn is a guess, not measured: turn in place and adjust it until a full turn of the controller turns you around once.'''

